  "body": "Before: `sign_upload` signed any envelope bytes. A malformed envelope (wrong length, bad magic, unsupported version, KDF or cipher id, out-of-range KDF parameters) got a valid signature, and every backup store then refused the upload, because `BackupStore::upload` runs `validate_envelope` before it looks at the signature.\n\nAfter: `sign_upload` runs the same `validate_envelope` first and returns `Result<[u8; 64], BackupError>`, refusing with `MalformedEnvelope` and the rule that failed. Valid envelopes sign byte for byte as before.\n\nHow: one predicate, `validate_envelope`, now serves both the signer and the store, so they cannot drift. The epoch rules (`StaleEpoch`, `Tombstoned`) stay receipt-only, since they depend on the store's record. All callers were tests in `backup.rs`; receipt-side tests that need a signature over a malformed envelope use a test-only `sign_upload_unchecked`.\n\nTesting: new `sign_upload_refuses_malformed_envelopes_at_sign_time`, and the malformed-header test now also checks the sign-time refusal. `cargo test -p id --lib backup::` passes (17), clippy `--all-targets --all-features` and fmt are clean.\n\nFixes #8842\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01YLT5JyFdZgVpkFFqSHMPHV)_\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797475573&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=10916&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F10916&signature=d2761006addbb4c976c77e56df17b53d24fe9be1957809d91232831c52fef8b7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/10916?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
